#: ../../index.md:3 65f23baaf5944022abc6807cd3c93870
msgid ""
"Welcome to the **InnoClaw** documentation — an AI-powered research "
"assistant web application similar to Google NotebookLM."
msgstr "欢迎阅读 **InnoClaw** 文档 —— 一个类似于 Google NotebookLM 的 AI 驱动的研究助手 Web 应用程序。"

#: ../../index.md:5 64c31062c9c046f78ceaed9412011b65
msgid ""
"Users open server-side folders as workspaces, browse and manage files, "
"and chat with AI grounded in workspace files via RAG (Retrieval-Augmented"
" Generation)."
msgstr "用户可以将服务器端文件夹作为工作空间打开，浏览和管理文件，并通过 RAG（检索增强生成）与基于工作空间文件的 AI 进行对话。"

